Our largest shareholders own a significant percentage of the share capital and voting rights of the Company.
As of December 31, 2020, RTW Investments LP. owned approximately 9.3% of Avadel’s outstanding shares (in the form of ADSs), Avoro Capital Advisors LLC owned approximately 7.5% of our outstanding shares (in the form of
ADSs) and Vivo Opportunity, LLC and certain of its affiliates owned approximately 6.1% of our outstanding shares (in the form of ADSs). To the extent these shareholders continue to hold a large percentage of our share capital and
voting rights, they will remain in a position to exert heightened influence in the election of the directors of the Company and in other corporate actions that require shareholder approval, as well as change of control transactions.
